ics or enter astronauts' eyes.", "s": 8.887, "e": 25.773}, {"text": "A private inventor, Paul Fisher, spent his own money developing the pressurized Space Pen and sold it to both NASA and the Soviet space agency for $2.95 each.", "s": 25.893, "e": 39.264}]}